{
  "workflowId": "300000331068633",
  "workflowCode": "ORA_WIS_PRODUCTION_READINESS_WORKSPACE_PRODUCT_UPDATES_ADVISOR",
  "name": "Product Updates Advisor",
  "description": "Provides updates on new releases of products or product changes driven upstream. (Up-Coming)\nApproved change order resulting in structure changes that Manufacturing engineer should uptake to prevent downstream errors. \nGenerate insights on recently releases to understand how product changes have affected shop-floor performance. \nSources:\n\nNew Item Revisions released for Production, Description of the revision\nChange orders that affect current products, and details of the change order (insights that might be useful beyond item structure), Description of change from change lines\nWork Definitions that are Active for the from effective dates indicating impacts that need to be absorbed\nItem structure changes that are incoming and impacting existing work definition > Changed order > Change order affected item structure components\nMeta data to extract: Change order, Status, Priority, Description, Reason Code, Affected objects > Item, Phase, Revision, Effective Date\nInsights/Outcomes:\n\nItems that need to be updated based on effective and demand on those effective dates. for example and Item is revised from A to B and the change order indicates effective date of Feb-15 and the current impacted line item has work definition that is not revised for the new item, it would have an impact in the work orders. Additionally the impact will be higher if the revision requires item structure changes to be up-taken. \nNew engineering releases that are upcoming that requires attention. \n\nThis agent is also responsible for switching the context in the app. if the user asks the question to switch focus to organization {Org} . please use this agent",
  "specification": {
    "jsonSchemaName": "Workflow.spec",
    "jsonSchemaVersion": "1",
