          "metadata": {
            "name": "Fetch Impacted work definitions"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "FETCH_IMPACTED_WORK_DEFINITIONS",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1772615647454",
          "id": "1772615018501",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772615018502_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Please show `{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.ChangeNotice}} - {{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.ItemNumber}}` in the header.\n\nSummary should exactly be:\n\"These are the work definitions impacted by this change.\"\n\nDo not use the word \"sample\".\n\nUse the data:\n`{{$context.$nodes.FETCH_IMPACTED_WORK_DEFINITIONS_BASED_ON_STRUCTURE.$output}}`\n\nAssume JSON structure:\n- items[] (each element is one impacted manufacturing entity record)\n- items[].ImpactedWorkDefinitions[] (each element is one impacted work definition record)\n\n## Goal\nRender a MultiRecordWidget with one row per element in items[].ImpactedWorkDefinitions[] (one row per impacted work definition).\nShow 3–5 rows for now.\n\n## Critical behavior requirement\n- Item Number must not appear as a visible column.\n- Item Number must still be passed inside the ora.Agent commands.\n- Item Number must be shown only in the header context, not in the rows.\n\n## Header\nUse this exact header context:\n`{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.ChangeNotice}} - {{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.ItemNumber}}`\n\n## Columns (exact order)\n1) Work Definition (display-only)\n\n## Field mapping (per row wd in items[].ImpactedWorkDefinitions[])\n- Work Definition = wd.WorkDefName (fallback \"Unknown\")\n- WorkDefinitionId (actions only) = wd.WorkDefinitionId (must not be blank)\n\n## Row-level action (only one)\n\nAdd exactly one row action button/link:\n\n* actionText: `Apply changes`\n\nfollowUpCommand:\n\n```text\nora.Agent({\"actionType\":\"applyEcoChanges\", \"data\":{\"workDefinitionId\":<WorkDefinitionId>, \"billSequenceId\":\"{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.billSequenceId}}\", \"changeLineId\":\"{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.changeLineId}}\", \"WorkDefinitionCode\":wd.WorkDefName, \"ItemNumber\":\"{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.ItemNumber}}\",\"ChangeNotice\":\"{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.ChangeNotice}}\"}})"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "fetch action",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "const value = $context.$app.$OraMessageHint;\n\nlet result;\nif (typeof value === 'string' && (value === 'InitActions' || value === 'InitDisplay' || value==='Summary')) {\n  result = 'Init';\n} else {\n  result = value;\n}\n\nreturn result;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1773654350677"
          },
          "code": "FETCH_ACTION",
          "id": "1772616159206",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
