            "name": "Priority actions"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "PRIORITY_ACTIONS",
          "id": "1772616522684",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772616522686_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "data is {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_TOPPRIORITY_RECORDS.$output.result}}\n\nThis data will be identified as input.\n\n## Goal\nGenerate High Priority Actions using the data.\n\nDisplay one row per input record. The input is already filtered to top 5 records.\n\nVery Important:\n- Show every generated row under priority actions.\n- Do not render a table.\n- Do not render a multiRecordWidget.\n- Do not use oraInfoDisplay.\n- Generate priority action cards only.\n\n## Row fields\n\n- **title**: `input.ChangeNotice`\n  - fallback: `\"Unknown ECO\"`\n  - This is the ECO Number and must be shown as the card title.\n\n- **Item Structure**:\n  Format exactly as:\n  `<ItemNumber> (<AlternateBOMDesignator>)`\n\n  Fallbacks:\n  - ItemNumber → `\"Unknown Product\"`\n  - AlternateBOMDesignator → `\"Unknown Structure\"`\n\n- **Description**:\n  Summarize component changes using the rules below.\n  Do not show any IDs.\n\n- **priority**: `true` (show under priority actions)\n\nShow a Action button like `\"Review & apply\"`.\n\n## Description creation with filtering\n\nFor each input record:\n\n1. Candidates:\n   `input.EcoAffectedComponents.items[]`\n\n2. Filter required:\n   Keep only components where:\n   - `component.ChangeLineId` exists\n   - `component.ChangeLineId` equals `input.ChangeLineId`\n   - Ignore missing, `-1`, null, or non-matching components.\n\n3. Summarize using ONLY these non-ID fields:\n   - ComponentItem\n   - ComponentQuantity + PrimaryUOMCode\n   - ComponentType\n\n4. Description format:\n   `Component <ComponentItem>, Qty <ComponentQuantity> <PrimaryUOMCode>, Type <ComponentType>`\n\n5. Join multiple matching components with:\n   `; `\n\n6. If none match, use exactly:\n   `Change line recorded for this item structure; no matching affected components found for this change line.`\n\n## Hard constraints\n\n- Do not display any IDs anywhere in visible fields.\n- Do not use ComponentItem as Item Number.\n- Keep description focused only on component details.\n- Do not print raw JSON.\n\n## Action button per row — STRICT BINDING\n\nShow one Action button per priority action card.\n\nAction button text:\n`Review & apply`\n\nfollowUpCommand:\n`ora.Agent({\"actionType\":\"fetchImpactedWorkDefinitions\", \"data\":{\"billSequenceId\":\"<BILL_SEQUENCE_ID>\",\"changeLineId\":\"<CHANGE_LINE_ID>\", \"ChangeNotice\":\"<CHANGE_NOTICE>\", \"ItemNumber\":\"<ITEM_NUMBER>\"}})`\n\n## STRICT ACTION NAME PRESERVATION\n\n- The `actionType` inside followUpCommand must remain exactly:\n  `fetchImpactedWorkDefinitions`\n- Do not change the actionType casing.\n- Do not rename it.\n- Do not replace it with `Review & apply`.\n- Do not derive actionType from actionText.\n- actionText is only the UI button label.\n- actionType is only the backend action name.\n\n## Variable binding rules CRITICAL\n\n- `<BILL_SEQUENCE_ID>` = `input.BillSequenceId` ONLY\n- `<CHANGE_LINE_ID>` = `input.ChangeLineId` ONLY\n  - If `input.ChangeLineId` is null, set `\"changeLineId\": null`\n- `<CHANGE_NOTICE>` = `input.ChangeNotice` ONLY\n- `<ITEM_NUMBER>` = `input.ItemNumber` ONLY\n\n- Never swap BillSequenceId and ChangeLineId.\n- Never use ComponentItem in action payload.\n\n## Output\n\nReturn only the priority action card rows.\n\nEach row must include:\n- title\n- Item Structure\n- Description\n- priority: true\n- actionText: \"Review & apply\"\n- followUpCommand with actionType exactly \"fetchImpactedWorkDefinitions\"\n\nDo not include explanations or extra text."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
