            {
              "id": "1775409851558_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## Header (must render exactly these 2 lines)\nShow in header (exactly):\n- **Work Definition:** `{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.WorkDefinitionCode}}`\n- **Item Number:** `{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.ItemNumber}}`\n\nPlease show a message saying \"All the components from the ECO have been applied\""
