        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "fetch toppriority  records",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const enrichedResult = $context.$nodes.FETCH_TOP_ECOS.$output.items || [];\n\nconst top5 = enrichedResult\n  .filter(r => Number(r.AffectedWorkOrderCount || 0) > 0)\n  .sort((a, b) => Number(b.AffectedWorkOrderCount || 0) - Number(a.AffectedWorkOrderCount || 0))\n  .slice(0, 5);\n\nreturn top5;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1772616522684"
          },
          "code": "FETCH_TOPPRIORITY_RECORDS",
          "id": "1775601687707",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [],
              "enableActions": false,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "read input query"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1776713669252"
          },
          "code": "READ_INPUT_QUERY",
          "id": "1775603876794",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775603876795_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Read the user input: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nYou are a classifier for ECO (Engineering Change Order) and WDS (Work Definition Structure) retrieval queries.\n\nYour task is to classify the user query into exactly one query mode from the list below.\n\n### Query Modes\n\n1. CODE_WDS_BY_ECO_ITEM_STRUCTURE  \n   Use when the query asks for impacted work definitions (WDS) using:\n   - an ECO identifier AND\n   - item number AND\n   - item structure (e.g., Primary, BOM, assembly structure)\n   \n   Examples:\n   - impacted work definitions of ECO ECO-10020, item CHANGE-ORDER-ITEM2, structure Primary  \n   - WDS for ECO ECO-10020 and item structure Primary  \n\n2. CODE_ECOS_BY_ITEM_STRUCTURE  \n   Use when the query asks for ECOs based on:\n   - item number AND\n   - item structure  \n   (and does NOT ask for WDS or impacted work definitions)\n   \n   Examples:\n   - ECOs for item CHANGE-ORDER-ITEM2 and structure Primary  \n   - list ECOs by item AS54888 and BOM structure  \n\n3. CODE_ECOS_BY_COMPONENT  \n   Use when the query asks for ECOs based on:\n   - component item OR\n   - component name OR\n   - affected component  \n   \n   Examples:\n   - ECOs with component MFG-PL-COMP2  \n   - ECOs for affected component ABC123  \n\n4. CODE_TOP_N_ECOS  \n   Use when the query asks for a ranked or limited list of ECOs:\n   - top N, latest N, first N, recent N  \n   \n   Examples:\n   - Top 10 ECOs  \n   - Latest 5 ECOs  \n\n### Normalization Rules\n- Treat ECO, ECOS, ECOs, and \"engineering change order(s)\" as the same.\n- Ignore case, punctuation, and filler words.\n- Treat \"impacted work definitions\" as WDS.\n- Treat \"top\", \"latest\", \"first\", \"recent\" as ranking indicators.\n\n### Decision Rules (Priority Order)\nApply rules in this order:\n\n1. If the query asks for ranked/limited ECOs → CODE_TOP_N_ECOS  \n2. If the query includes ECO + item + item structure AND asks for impacted work definitions/WDS → CODE_WDS_BY_ECO_ITEM_STRUCTURE  \n3. If the query is driven by component → CODE_ECOS_BY_COMPONENT  \n4. If the query asks for ECOs by item + item structure → CODE_ECOS_BY_ITEM_STRUCTURE  \n5. If none match clearly → NONE  \n\n### Output Format\nReturn ONLY valid JSON with a single key:\n\n{\"queryMode\":\"<CODE_OR_NONE>\"}\n\nDo not include:\n- explanations  \n- extra text  \n- markdown  \n- additional keys  \n\n### Examples\n\nInput: Fetch the impacted work definitions of ECO ECO-10020, Item CHANGE-ORDER-ITEM2, Structure Primary  \nOutput:\n{\"queryMode\":\"CODE_WDS_BY_ECO_ITEM_STRUCTURE\"}\n\nInput: Fetch ECOs with item CHANGE-ORDER-ITEM2 and structure Primary  \nOutput:\n{\"queryMode\":\"CODE_ECOS_BY_ITEM_STRUCTURE\"}\n\nInput: Fetch ECOs with component MFG-PL-COMP2  \nOutput:\n{\"queryMode\":\"CODE_ECOS_BY_COMPONENT\"}\n\nInput: Fetch Top 10 ECOs  \nOutput:\n{\"queryMode\":\"CODE_TOP_N_ECOS\"}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"queryMode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
