AffectedWorkOrderCount.  \n  If AffectedWorkOrderCount > 0 → **High**  \n  If AffectedWorkOrderCount <= 0 → **Low**\n\n## Action — STRICT BINDING\n\nCreate only one action per row. Do not create duplicates.\n\nUse this exact action object:\n\n{\n\"text\": \"View Impacted Work Definitions\",\n\"command\": \"ora.Agent({\\\"actionType\\\":\\\"fetchImpactedWorkDefinitions\\\",\\\"data\\\":{\\\"billSequenceId\\\":\\\"<BILL_SEQUENCE_ID>\\\",\\\"changeLineId\\\":\\\"<CHANGE_LINE_ID>\\\",\\\"ChangeNotice\\\":\\\"<CHANGE_NOTICE>\\\",\\\"ItemNumber\\\":\\\"<ITEM_NUMBER>\\\"}})\"\n}\n\n## Binding rules\n\n- <BILL_SEQUENCE_ID> = BillSequenceId  \n- <CHANGE_LINE_ID> = ChangeLineId  \n- <CHANGE_NOTICE> = ChangeNotice  \n- <ITEM_NUMBER> = ItemNumber  \n- If ChangeLineId is null, set \"changeLineId\": null  \n- Never swap billSequenceId and changeLineId  \n- Never use ComponentItem in the action payload  \n\n## Output\n\nReturn only the MultiRecordWidget-ready list of rows, one per input record.  \nDo not include explanations or extra text."
