              "value": "### Render ONLY:\n1) A header line  \n2) A message line\n\n## Header line\n\"No ECOs require attention right now\" **ONLY** (Must be exact word to word) (Must be in Bold and bigger text size)\n\n## Message line\n\"There are no ECOs with active demand in the current monitoring window which are not applied to the work definitions\""
