          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1773053969317_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## Output Contract (MUST FOLLOW EXACTLY)\nPlease note that the Panel header should be Impacted Work Orders. Do not show any thing else\n\n### IMPORTANT: Disable implicit actions\n- Do not generate any drilldown/navigation behavior.\n- Do not treat any cell value as a link.\n- Do not add any default “Actions”, overflow menus, row-click actions, or drilldown icons.\n\n### Render ONLY:\n1) A header section\n2) One message line\n3) One pre-table description line\n4) One table\n5) One action button after the table\n\n\n### Messages (must render exactly)\n** `{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.ChangeNotice}}` has been successfully applied.**\n**Impacted Work Orders for Work Definition `{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.WorkDefinitionCode}}` and Item Number `{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.ItemNumber}}`**\n\n### Data source (ONLY this array)\nIterate ONLY over:\n`{{$context.$nodes.FETCH_WO.$output.items}}`\n\n- Ignore any links.\n- Ignore each item’s links.\n- Do not infer any action from any links, including drilldown.\n\n### Table structure (MUST be exactly 3 columns; no more, no less)\nColumns (exact order and labels):\n1. Work order number\n2. Item Number\n3. Status\n\n### Row mapping rules (STRICT)\nFor each item `wo`:\n- Work order number = plain text `wo.WorkOrderNumber`\n- Item Number = plain text `wo.ItemNumber`\n- Status = plain text `wo.WorkOrderStatusName`\n  - If `wo.WorkOrderStatusName` is null/undefined/empty => `N/A`\n\n### Prohibitions (CRITICAL)\n- Do not output drilldown, open, view, details, navigate, row-click behavior, or any other action.\n- Do not output any JSON blocks, metadata, explanations, or extra text.\n\n(critical) action button at the bottom only.pls do not show anywhere else.and tie this to the below mentioned action PLEASE DO NOT MISS THIS\n### Action button\nActionText: \"Sync Work Orders\" ONLY\n\n### followUpCommand\n```js\nora.Agent({\n  \"actionType\": \"syncWorkOrder\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"workDefinitionId\": \"{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.WorkDefinitionId}}\",\n    \"billSequenceId\": \"{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.billSequenceId}}\",\n    \"changeLineId\": \"{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.changeLineId}}\",\n    \"WorkDefinitionCode\": \"{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.WorkDefinitionCode}}\",\n    \"ItemNumber\": \"{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION.$output.result.data.ItemNumber}}\",\n    \"workDefinitionNameId\": {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_EXISTING_WORK_DEFINITION_MATERIALS.$output.items[0].WorkDefinitionNameId}}\n  }\n})"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
